fe360056-00da-458b-998c-9e2b9b3ed6a4	48c8273f-9826-44f6-affc-af059836fc43	assistant	Your current role is **Auditor** (username: *Yope Auditor*, email: *auditor@vector.com*).\n\nIn this role, you have read access to inspect various modules across the ERP to review and audit company data. Based on your permissions, you can view records in the following areas:\n\n* **CRM & Customer Service:** Clients, client contacts, complaints, site visits, and feedback.\n* **Creative & Design:** Design BOMs, idea hub, prototype requests, staff leaves, design tasks, design versions, and communications.\n* **Sales & Orders:** Customer orders, order items, invoices, invoice items, payments, warranties, items catalog, and legacy proforma invoices.\n* **Finance:** Chart of accounts, general journals, journal lines, payroll, purchases, purchase items, sales records, sales items, tax rates, and finance sync logs.\n* **Production & Inventory:** Deliveries, installations, job orders, production orders, machines, machine maintenance checklists, maintenance logs, inventory stock master, and inventory movements.\n* **Marketing:** Activities, campaigns, campaign targets, expenses, market insights, plans, product/service catalog, proformas, proposals, and tenders.\n* **Organization & Communication:** Internal messages, user notes, notifications, files metadata, and ERP users.	2026-09-19 09:54:01.825809+00
